/Title (Designed and developed an intelligent fire-detection system using computer vision and machine learning. Trained a custom YOLO model to accurately identify fire in real-time video streams and integrated it with OpenCV for image processing. Implemented the system in Python, enabling fast detection and generating alerts when fire patterns were recognized. This project demonstrates skills in model training, dataset preparation, real-time inference, and practical computer-vision deployment.)
